    <string name="ui_guest_records_stay_on_this_device_2">Guest records stay on this device and are not uploaded automatically. After login, inventory, shopping, nicknames and household names are saved on the connected server and shared with household members. Caches are separated by account and household. Login tokens are encrypted; passwords are not stored. The system speech service may use the internet under its own data policy.</string>
    <string name="ui_camera__opened_only_when_you_choose">Camera: opened only when you choose to take a photo.\nPhotos: only the images you select are accessed.\nVoice: the microphone is used when you start system speech input.\nNotifications: in-app alerts only; no system push permission.</string>
    <string name="ui_export_inventory_and_shopping_as_json">Export inventory and shopping as JSON without passwords or login tokens. Photos are not uploaded or embedded in the export. Appearance, alert lead time and saved location choices belong to this device.</string>
    <string name="ui_export_current_data">Export current data</string>
    <string name="ui_clear_stock_and_shopping_records">Clear stock and shopping records</string>
    <string name="ui_your_profile__household_and_settings_are">Your profile, household and settings are kept. Original photos in the system gallery are not deleted.</string>
    <string name="ui_cloud_households_do_not_support_clearing">Cloud households do not support clearing all records at once. Review and delete items individually.</string>
    <string name="ui_getting_started">Getting started</string>
    <string name="ui_1__add_items_by_photo__voice">1. Add items by photo, voice or manual entry.\n2. Check the name, quantity, unit and location, then confirm.\n3. Set minimum stock and expiry dates to see items needing attention.\n4. Add items to your shopping list. After shopping, tap Receive, enter the actual quantity and confirm.</string>
    <string name="ui_common_questions">Common questions</string>
    <string name="ui_why_are_photos_not_recognized__image">Why are photos not recognized? Image recognition is not connected yet; enter the details yourself.\nVoice unavailable? The device needs a service that recognizes Chinese. You can type the original text instead.\nWill I lose my data? Records survive restarts. Uninstalling or clearing app data removes local records, so export first.\nWhat can AI do? The local assistant answers stock, expiry and restock questions using confirmed records. It does not change them automatically.</string>
