    <string name="ui_supports_local_guest_records__household_cloud">Supports local guest records, household cloud inventory and shared shopping. This build supports stock Q&amp;A and confirmed drafts for adding, moving, using stock and manual shopping; available actions depend on the server. Image recognition, cloud photo backup, opening, discarding and automatic plan confirmation are not available here yet. See Privacy and security for data details.</string>
